spoiler/answer:

I think the only way to reach it is through a magic portal located in one of
the vault rooms way down in the dungeon.  It's a single level with lots of
gold.  If you use object detection potions on every floor (I never genocide
nymphs, so there's never a short supply of object detection potions.)  You'll
find the vaults.  Walk around in each one till you find the one with the
magic portal.  It's usually somewhere in the level 20-30 range, it seems,
though I've only been there a couple of times.

